@HostAddress = http://localhost:5192

### 1. Register a Doctor
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Sarah Jenkins",
  "specialization": "Cardiology",
  "maxDailyAppointments": 20
}

### 2. Get All Doctors
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/doctors

### 3. Register a Patient
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

### 4. Get All Patients
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/patients

### 5. Book an Appointment (replace doctorId & patientId with real Guids)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "date": "2026-11-06"
}

### 6. Patient Arrives - Physical Check-In (assigns QueueNumber)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/check-in

### 7. View Daily Queue for a Doctor
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments/queue?doctorId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&date=2026-11-06

### 8. Skip Absent Patient
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/skip

### 9. Complete Consultation
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete

### 10. Cancel Appointment
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
